{"id":"602627","name":"玉米发糕","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/602627/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"一条"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"3g"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取出玉米粒，清洗下，放入随行杯，加适量水。","img":"images/602627/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"打成玉米汁。","img":"images/602627/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"玉米汁倒入碗中，加入适量面粉，搅拌。","img":"images/602627/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加白糖，搅拌。","img":"images/602627/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加酵母和泡打粉，搅拌。","img":"images/602627/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入密封容器发酵到两倍大。","img":"images/602627/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"碗里抹油。","img":"images/602627/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用勺子将面糊放入碗中，加点果干点缀。","img":"images/602627/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火烧开后，改中火蒸三十分钟。","img":"images/602627/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}